{
  "about": "What Python's str() gives for a JSON value (json.loads, then str), and the TUI's field() of it, at master_head. desktop/ui/js/sanitize.js pyStr and field give the same for every vector. 'lost' lists values whose difference JSON.parse has already dropped, so the desktop cannot show what Python shows; each names what the desktop shows and why.",
